    "body": "You can read my post as \"exact priority enum values TBD\".\r\n\r\nI did indicate script specified priority would be a hint and not a guarantee.  I think this value could reflect intent, but not necessarily exact implementation detail.  I would not want this API to constrain the implementation.",
