    "updated_at": "2018-06-11T02:07:16Z",
    "body": "Also, if Priority Hints exposes an `importance` attribute on elements, then there should probably also be an expose `Request.importance` and `RequestInit.importance`.  Feels natural and I don't see a good reason to hide them.  Also, you will need that if you want service workers to be able to preserve the importance value if its doing anything more complicated than a pass-through fetch.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
